  "description_short": "Backpacker lodge with ocean views, wood-fired pizzas, and a laid-back bar vibe steps from Wilderness Beach.",
  "description_long": "Perched above Wilderness Beach, this backpacker lodge offers more than just budget beds—it's become a local favourite for wood-fired pizzas and sunset drinks. The restaurant and bar welcome everyone, not just guests, with a relaxed atmosphere that captures the easy-going spirit of the Garden Route coast.\n\nThe pizza menu keeps things simple and satisfying, with generous toppings and that distinctive wood-fired char. Grab a table on the deck when the weather's right, or settle into the indoor bar area where travellers and locals mingle over cold drinks. The ocean views are a constant backdrop, making even a casual meal feel special.\n\nLocated on Western Road, you're a short walk from the beach and Wilderness village centre. It's the kind of place where you might pop in for a quick bite and end up staying for another round, watching the sun dip into the Indian Ocean.",
